## Context

Follow-up of 1393 (PR #2083). The author, viewing the d77349fe page on
2026-10-31: "Nicer and nicer! Blank column 1 label when nothing to show
(current is greyed). Col 1 width enlargeable. Rethink the color scheme and the
legend -- convey sense."

## Exit criteria

- [ ] A cursor label row with nothing under the red line shows nothing (no
      greyed fallback text); the static lane name stays available elsewhere
      (e.g. on hover or the agent bar label), at the implementer's judgment
- [ ] The label column width is user-resizable (drag handle on its right
      edge), with a sensible minimum; bar layout follows
- [ ] Colour scheme designed for meaning, using the `dataviz` skill: group
      hues by what time is spent on. Proposed grouping (adjust with reason):
      agent spans and model turns = neutral "thinking/presence"; subagent +
      worker = one warm "delegation" family; tests = a distinct "verification"
      hue; file and git = quiet "housekeeping" tones; other = faintest.
      No two legend entries share a colour (today "tool" and "other" do)
- [ ] The legend is grouped and labelled by those meanings, and reads in one
      glance; colours pass a contrast/colour-blind check per the skill
- [ ] Self-contained page; JSON export unchanged by this ticket (byte-compare
      on a fixture); existing tests pass
- [ ] Rendered for d77349fe-10eb-46dd-a58c-d5723e771c4d, headless Firefox
      screenshot; the author checks interaction
